WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.400
And here are your extra-large beers.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.920
Can I order something else?

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.940
Go right ahead.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.900
One order of fried chicken, one broiled pork
 with green onions, and two potato salads.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.060
So that's one fried chicken, one green 
onion pork, and two potato salads.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.240
Got it!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.740
We'd like to close our tab, please!

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.450
Sure! I'll be right with you.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.860
That'll be 3,850 yen.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.880
Card, please.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.420
Certainly. Here we go.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.590
Thank you very much! Hope you'll come again!

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.640
You've really gotten the 
hang of this, Hy-chan.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.950
Maybe I should make you a shift lead.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:41.020
A shift lead? What is that?

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.850
It's the employee with the most power.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.530
The most power...?

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.040
That sounds good.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:59.390
But I guess you're the only 
employee here anyway, huh?

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.340
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.130
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:16.920
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.630
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:18.420
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.370
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.050
<b>Restoration Plan No. 5

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.340
I'm exhausted.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.010
Even though I'm getting used to this...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:41.850
Wait, no.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.680
My job at the pub is just a means to an end!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:49.290
I have no choice if I want to gather 
the mana crystals scattered across the land.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:52.360
I needn't grow accustomed to this life.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.190
I mustn't, I mustn't.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.570
Hey. You there.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.150
Could I ask you a few questions?

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.400
I got a report about a strangely 
dressed character walking around.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.350
Would you mind telling me 
what you're doing here?

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:10.790
Hey, don't run!

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:12.710
<i>Yeah, right!</i>

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.210
<i>I haven't forgotten your pompous attitude</i>

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:18.210
<i>from the many times you've caught me before!</i>

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.510
Maybe there are mana crystals in here...

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.690
Are you okay?

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.870
That's dangerous, you know?

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.460
Can you tell me your name?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.520
None of your business!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.030
Why don't we contact your parents, okay?

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.220
Could that be... a mana crystal?

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.520
Hey, you!

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.270
What are you doing here?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.380
None of your business!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.840
Why don't we talk about it at the station?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.800
<b>Police Station</b>

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:06.700
<i>Last time he caught me, not only 
was I detained for ages...</i>

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.690
Hey. Don't go causing trouble.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.060
Don't touch me!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.730
We are so sorry for any 
disturbance she's caused.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.230
<i>I was also subjected to the humiliation 
of being picked up by my boss and landlord!</i>

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.070
<i>Hell if I'm doing that again!</i>

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.030
Hey, wait!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.860
<i>You're not catching me today!</i>

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.630
Why did you run away?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.990
I'm really tired.

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:38.020
I just wanted to get home and go to sleep.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.300
That's the only reason!

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.340
But you were literally sprinting full tilt.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.900
Because you were chasing me!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.300
Anyway, using a bike against 
a pedestrian is unfair!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:51.680
Well, for now, I'm going 
to contact your guardians.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.900
<i>You're dead if you get caught again.</i>

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.150
Please! Just don't call my landlord!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.210
The boss! My boss is okay, though!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:07.490
Your boss, then... 
Could you give me their contact info?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.190
Oh, excuse me a moment.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:10.790
Yes?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:15.070
Indeed, I've detained the suspicious 
character that was reported earlier.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.050
She's got dark hair 
and is wearing a revealing outfit...

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.960
What? A different description?

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:25.370
Someone with light, soft, voluminous hair?

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.690
With ribbons?

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.160
Dressed like a magical girl?

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.680
And they were just spotted? In the park?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.200
<i>I can't believe it.</i>

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.140
<i>The magical girl is here... 
in the human world?</i>

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.400
<i>She appeared out of nowhere,</i>

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.040
<i>destroyed the Dark Lord's mana crystal,</i>

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.380
<i>and brought ruin upon the Dark Realm!</i>

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:48.550
<i>She's the reason I have 
to endure all this. It's her fault!</i>

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.700
<i>She's my sworn enemy.</i>

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.690
<i>I never expected to hear 
she was in a place like this...</i>

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.320
You must apprehend her at once!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.690
You know her?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.140
<i>Know</i> her?!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.820
She's the one who ruined my home world!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.410
Huh?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.740
What are you talking about?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.000
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.050
<i>This guy doesn't understand anything!</i>

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.640
I'm going to go catch her myself!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.010
Hey, you! Wait!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.180
<i>Curse you, magical girl!</i>

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.020
<i>I'm going to catch you with my own hands</i>

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.440
<i>and have my revenge for what 
you did in the Dark Realm!</i>

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.710
There she is!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.580
I've found you at last.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:39.040
Now you shall pay for what you did to the 
Dark Lord, for destroying the Dark Realm...

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:42.250
Prepare to meet your destiny!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:47.860
Pyrica Pumple magical power!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.180
Who the hell are you?!

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.040
Um... So what's your name?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.980
Magic Girl Miracle Pipin!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.130
And where do you live?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.900
On Twinkle Little Star.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.970
And may I see some identification?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.280
So you don't live around here, huh?

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:25.250
I'm on my way home from work.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.510
And what do you do?

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.340
I'm a math teacher.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.640
Aren't you cold dressed like that?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.270
A little.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:46.970
Thank you so much. We really owe you.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.480
Oh, no, not at all!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.350
<i>Wait, she shrunk?</i>

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.990
Come on, Hy-chan.
 Don't you have something to say?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:57.040
The magical girl... had... a beard...

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.200
Hy-chan?

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:01.300
She had an encounter
 with a strange character earlier.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.810
Oh, my.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.420
C'mon. We're going home.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.250
Noogie. Noogie, noogie. Noogie.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.330
<i>D-Damn it!</i>

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.650
<i>That cursed magical girl!</i>

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.170
Who's that?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.410
I've gotta get to work.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.540
What's with the outfit?

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.480
What's it look like?

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.920
I've got a cold.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:40.640
The pub is closed today 'cause my sister 
is completely useless since she's sick, too.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:42.780
Honestly, though, get a 
freakin' cell phone already.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:46.330
I have to come over here to tell 
you every little thing myself.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:50.880
What?

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.800
Weakling. You really are such a weakling.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.560
A cold? A cold? A <i>cold</i>?!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.530
You look like crap!

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.270
You little...

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.540
A mere cold debilitates you!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.690
That's humans for you.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.360
This is what you get for making 
a fool of me all the time.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.280
You'd better go lie in bed
and think about what you've done.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.660
It's from the weather changing.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.570
It got cold all of a sudden,

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.980
so you're going to get sick too if 
you keep walking around like that.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.480
Same with the lone T-shirt 
you wear as a li'l squirt.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.080
I swear you're gonna catch cold.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.490
<i>I'm</i> gonna catch cold?

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:34.050
I think not, moron!

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.510
Me? Sick?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.320
<i>My throat hurts so bad.</i>

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.280
<i>Maybe it's not pain...</i>

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.540
<i>It feels like the whole thing 
is completely dried up!</i>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.700
<i>Could I have been poisoned?</i>

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.700
<i>No. I didn't go out at all yesterday.</i>

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.300
<i>There's no way that could've happened.</i>

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.370
<i>Could this be... a cold?</i>

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.580
<i>Have I actually gotten sick?</i>

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:12.190
<i>People fell ill in the Dark Realm,
but never me.</i>

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.680
I have a cold. I'm so sorry.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.960
So terribly sorry!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.720
You're all a disgrace!

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.260
<i>Only those with weak 
magic powers catch colds.</i>

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:28.480
<i>Is this because mine have weakened?</i>

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.890
<i>No... Was the landlord right?
Is this because of how I dress?</i>

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.030
<i>Ah, crap.</i>

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.030
<i>My head feels all funny, too.</i>

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.430
<i>Why don't I go back to bed?</i>

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:43.530
<i>Maybe I'll feel better when I wake up.</i>

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.790
<i>The ceiling looks higher than normal...</i>

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:53.920
<i>Why did I have to catch a cold 
in the human world?</i>

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.790
<i>Everything was going so well 
for me in the Dark Realm.</i>

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.400
<i>I had all the magic power 
and authority I could want,</i>

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.850
<i>lots of underlings who adored me,</i>

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.660
<i>and the Dark Lord, too...</i>

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:12.090
<i>But now? No magic powers. 
No authority. And I'm all alone.</i>

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.940
<i>The Great Jahy was mentally
 weakened as well.</i>

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:19.720
<i>Who would follow me in this compromised state?</i>

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:24.910
<i>I bet if Druj saw me like this,</i>

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.660
<i>she'd abandon me, too.</i>

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.910
I'm so disillusioned.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:39.260
<i>Can I really restore the Dark Realm?</i>

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.210
<i>With no power?</i>

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.110
<i>In this form?</i>

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.330
<i>My throat hurts.</i>

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.720
<i>This is so hard.</i>

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:48.810
<i>Someone...</i>

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.660
<i>Someone...</i>

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:58.920
<i>Someone...</i>

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.840
Did I wake you up?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.830
The rice porridge will be done soon.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.560
I'm sorry for barging in like this.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:16.870
Ryou-chan knocked and knocked, 
but there was no answer.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.920
I was worried, so I used the 
spare key and let myself in.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.080
Here you go.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.430
Eat up before it gets cold.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:33.250
Why... Why would you do all this for me?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.430
Because it gets lonely all by yourself.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.520
It's hard when you've got a cold.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.410
Here. Say "ah!"

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.010
There, there.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:55.940
You had a rough time, didn't you?

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:59.460
You're all right. You'll be better soon.

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:02.170
What's this? You cryin', Ja-ko?

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.000
I am not!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:06.930
And how dare you?! You infected me!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.950
Gross. Finish eating 
before you run your mouth.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.980
Here. Medicine and some 
stuff for your throat.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.480
Finish your food, take this, and sleep.

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:20.420
Also, make sure you stay hydrated.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.690
<i>Taking pity on me...</i>

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.860
<i>What are they plotting?!</i>

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.740
You look like a boiled octopus!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.380
What a mess!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:32.700
Oh, Ryou-chan. You shouldn't say that.

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.700
That's what she gets
 for lettin' me have it earlier.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.710
You! Come to laugh at me, did you?!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:39.710
Go home!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.880
You got what you came for, so beat it!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.300
All right, all right.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:48.290
Just make sure you pay your 
rent once you're better.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.080
Hy-chan, make sure to keep warm and rest.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:57.490
I'll bring you some hand-me-downs 
next time, so bundle up properly.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.550
It's getting colder.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:08.860
I left some jelly and 
lunch for you in the fridge.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.330
Make sure to eat it 
and take your medicine afterward.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.120
I'll come check on you again soon.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.630
Okay, okay.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:20.920
Jeez.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.880
They're so weird.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:28.680
Again?!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.360
Well? Did you forget something?

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.460
<i>The magical girl?</i>

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.820
<i>What's she doing at my dwelling?</i>

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.460
<i>And was she always so huge...?</i>

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.950
Sorry to intrude.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.340
Do you live here, little one?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.830
<i>She doesn't realize it's me?</i>

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.290
<i>Then this is my chance for a surprise attack!</i>

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.570
<i>I've found you at last.</i>

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:04.170
<i>Now you shall pay for what you did to the 
Dark Lord, for destroying the Dark Realm...</i>

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:08.040
Prepare to meet your destiny!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.250
What just happened?!

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.940
Are you okay, kid?!

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:18.600
Leave me alone!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.900
Stay back! Stay back, I say!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.560
<i>How is she so strong?</i>

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:29.610
Have no fear. I am on your side.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.660
That mana crystal...

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.520
Would you let me have it?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.500
<i>She'll take the crystal.</i>

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.210
<i>Everyone will be turn their backs on me.</i>

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.540
Jaheek...

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.120
<i>In other words... I'm doomed.</i>

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.450
<i>M-My future!</i>

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.470
Now, please hand over the crystal.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.840
N-Never!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.310
Then you leave me no choice.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.120
Damn. Always forgetting something...

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:07.900
What's wrong, Ja-ko?!

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.180
My mana crystal!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.990
Hey! The hell are you doin' to her?!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.630
Saving her.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.140
You mean robbing her?!

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.200
Talk about a suspicious-lookin' character!

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.880
S-Suspicious?!

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.170
Clearly, I'm c-cute!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:27.550
It's so messed up that you're assaultin' 
a little girl dressed like that!

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:28.580
Little girl?

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.590
I'm not... a little girl...

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.690
Hello? Is this the police?

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:35.430
The police? You don't need to call them.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.430
For I am a magical girl of justice!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:43.440
I protect people from the terrible
 calamities the mana crystals cause!

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:50.810
We'll meet again!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:52.090
Don't ever come here again!

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.420
What's her damage?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.180
You okay, Ja-ko?

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:05.290
I c-could have defeated her... 
a-all by myself...

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:09.360
I wasn't s-scared. Not one bit.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.770
<i>I was terrified!</i>

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.100
<i>I thought I was going to die.</i>

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.640
<i>I thought she'd take my mana crystal.</i>

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.080
Ah, jeez...

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:23.540
Upsy-daisy.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.020
Damn, you're on fire.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.360
I think your fever went up.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.150
Unhand me!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.670
I can walk by my...

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:36.040
She's not going to come back, 
so get some rest for real this time.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:42.490
She really won't come back?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.250
Nah, she's gone.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.960
I'll stand guard, so you focus
 on kicking this cold.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.020
Eat this!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:11.600
Hey!

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.780
Get ready to taste my revenge!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:17.650
For the Dark Lord! For shattering 
the mana crystal! For everything!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:22.840
<i>In her dreams, the Great Jahy
 beat the magical girl to a pulp!</i>

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:32.260
<i>Her little sleeping face...
looks downright evil.</i>

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.460
<i>The strongest wrestler!</i>

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.850
<i>The Butcher of the Ring!</i>

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.780
<i>It's the savage rent collector, 
Deadly Landlord!</i>

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:24.980
<i>And her opponent tonight
 is a complete unknown to us.</i>

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:27.780
<i>Her birthplace? A mystery!
Her affiliation? A mystery!</i>

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:31.540
<i>Only her slogan, "Restore the 
Dark Realm," waves as she walks!</i>

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:36.200
<i>The Dark Realm's second-in-command,
 the Great Jahy,</i>

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:40.330
<i>makes a grandiose entrance!</i>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:49.850
<b>Thirty-Minute Single Point Match</b>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:49.850
<b>JAHY</b>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:49.850
<b>LANDLORD</b>

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:46.360
<i>It's the landlord against Jahy!</i>

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:50.650
<i>We've seen this match-up again and again,
 but it always ends in a draw!</i>

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.290
<i>Neither of them gives an inch!</i>

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:55.310
<i>Will we finally see a victor today?!</i>

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.710
Pay your rent.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.860
No. Never.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:10.100
<i>Oh, and the hostilities begin!</i>

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.580
<i>The bell for the battle between
these beasts has just rung!</i>

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.420
Pay your rent!

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.130
Never!

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:24.330
<i>Say what you want, but the landlord is the 
righteous superstar of Queen's Real Estate!</i>

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.620
<i>On the other side, we have Jahy,</i>

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:28.700
<i>whose "If I can't pay, I can't pay" 
refusal has her up against a wall!</i>

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.560
<i>Just how much is she holding out on us?!</i>

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:31.830
Today you will...

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:32.770
Today I won't...

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:34.850
Pay your rent!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:35.790
Even if I could,

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:36.810
I never would!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.830
<i>The Deadly Landlord strikes first!</i>

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:44.420
<i>It's an instant cobra twist!
 Behold the power of a landlord!</i>

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:47.530
<i>You can hear the hellish roar
 of a rent collector!</i>

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.880
Pay up, pay up, pay up!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.980
Never, never, never!

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.200
<i>She breaks free of the cobra twist!</i>

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.770
<i>And... immediately counterattacks!</i>

00:21:58.770 --> 00:21:59.940
<i>Behold the power of the broke!</i>

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:02.710
<i>It's Jahy's Rage Llave! Llave! Llave!</i>

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:04.920
I'll never pay!

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:07.840
<i>Unbelievable! Landlord escaped the llave!</i>

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.550
<i>Right into a sleeper hold!</i>

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:13.950
Pay up! Pay up! Pay up! Pay up! Pay up!

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:16.520
Never! Never! Never! Never! Never! Never!

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:22.570
<i>Oh, she threw her into the ropes!</i>

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:24.120
Pay your rent!

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:26.570
<i>And she comes back with a lariat!</i>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.680
<i>An incredible back-and-forth!</i>

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:30.490
<i>No, a clash of wills!</i>

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:32.940
I told you I won't do it!

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:34.990
That all you got?

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:37.250
Just cough it up!

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:40.540
I told you! I refuse!

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:42.700
<i>Pro wrestling at its finest!</i>

00:22:42.700 --> 00:22:44.270
<i></i>This<i> is pro wrestling!</i>

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:45.420
<i>Never dodge a blow!</i>

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.570
<i>Take a hit and return it!</i>

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:49.040
<i>It's a harmony of trust and violence!</i>

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>How will this fated battle turn out?!</i>

00:22:53.360 --> 00:22:56.520
Seriously, enough is enough!

00:22:56.670 --> 00:23:00.770
O-Over my dead body! Never!

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:06.190
<i>Another tie!</i>

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:08.310
<i>How many more times will the 
conclusion be postponed?!</i>

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:12.160
<i>We're in tears over this predictable 
outcome we all wanted!</i>

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:14.120
You've gotten better.

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:16.330
You, too, Ja-ko.

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:20.330
Pay your rent!

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:21.460
Never!

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:24.590
<b>Commentator</b>

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:24.590
<b>Announcer</b>

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:24.590
So, any word from our commentator, Boss?

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:27.680
Pay up!

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:28.200
Never!

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:28.570
Pay up!

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:29.040
Never!

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:29.340
Pay up!

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:29.730
Never!

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:30.000
Pay up!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.270
Never!

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:33.020
We're out of time. Tune in again next week.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.930
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.930
<b>The Great Jahy Doesn't Seem to Stand a Chance...</b>
